Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.34,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,ANALYZER
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.34,0:00:04.68,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,-------------------------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 1,0:00:04.68,0:00:07.02,Sign,ELECMON,0,0,0,,--------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big melankee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.42,0:00:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,uratoun
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.46,0:00:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:37.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I went fishing, I never\Nwould catch what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our little group decided to explore\Nthe rest of this new island,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.30,0:01:43.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and when we came upon\Nwhat looked like a church,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.76,0:01:45.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well, we were more than\Na little surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.82,0:01:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The people inside looked like\Nthey were celebrating Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.12,0:01:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have known they\Nweren't ordinary people.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.70,0:01:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As it turned out, it\Nwas the Bakemon holiday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and these people were actually ghosts\Nwho were planning on eating us.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.12,0:02:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thankfully, Joe figured out how\Nto take away Lord Bakuman's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.56,0:02:03.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just another day in paradise.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.58,0:02:15.03,Sign,TITLE,0,0,180,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}{\fad(300,0)}{\fs30\b1}Adventure! Patamon and I
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.72,0:02:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boken! Patamon to Boku!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.66,0:02:21.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is totally no fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:25.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Patamon?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.50,0:02:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just when I think this place is a\Nbomb, it all goes creepy on me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.08,0:02:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure would be awful without Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.56,0:02:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have failed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.68,0:02:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.42,0:02:50.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We almost had them, Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then just...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.54,0:02:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:56.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, spare me your pathetic excuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.16,0:02:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, master, please,\Nplease, just put me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.60,0:03:03.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.10,0:03:15.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, Patamon, I like\Nswimming and everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:18.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but that waterfall almost\Nknocked off my underpants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.88,0:03:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think my wings shrunk. This fits.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:23.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.02,0:03:31.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look at all that water. Somebody must have\Nlet the bathtub overflow. I'm not scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.08,0:03:33.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of being separated from the others And
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.18,0:03:39.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,being lost and being\Nhomesick Poor little TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish I could help
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.04,0:03:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What would Biyomon do if she were here?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.90,0:03:48.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Biyomon, Digivolve to
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.02,0:04:04.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to fly high in the sky, too, but\Nsomehow I can't seem to Digivolve. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.40,0:04:07.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.28,0:04:13.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to fly, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.36,0:04:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to Digivolve!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.74,0:04:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To what? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.66,0:04:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, what will you digivolve into?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.52,0:04:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't they tell you at Digimon\Nschool or something? Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.72,0:04:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I won't actually know until I\Ndo digivolve and find out what I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.30,0:04:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, so it's a mystery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.66,0:04:37.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe you digivolve into\Nsomething like this. Porkymon!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.56,0:04:41.55,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}TabunKonnamon (It's-Probably-Like-This-mon)
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.56,0:04:41.55,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.56,0:04:41.55,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Imaginary Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.56,0:04:41.55,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.56,0:04:41.55,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Imaginary
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.56,0:04:41.55,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:04:35.56,0:04:41.55,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Buubuu Attack
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.06,0:04:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With super strong oink attack\Nand the power to, um, oink!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:43.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how about Hawkmon?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.99,0:04:51.39,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}KittoKonnamon (It-Must-Be-Like-This-mon)
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.99,0:04:51.39,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Adult
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.99,0:04:51.39,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Imaginary Digimon
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.99,0:04:51.39,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.99,0:04:51.39,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Imaginary
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.99,0:04:51.39,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:04:46.99,0:04:51.39,Sign,TAKERU,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Hippopota Vacuum
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.38,0:04:52.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super hog smell and the power to snort\Nup enemies in a single sniff like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.32,0:04:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am not a pig, TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.64,0:04:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay to be a pig!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:01.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it is, especially\Nfor pigs, but that's not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.10,0:05:06.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear a train coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.66,0:05:13.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I betcha we can jump on and ride the\Ncaboose all the way back to summer camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.38,0:05:19.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought I found something.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.64,0:05:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, maybe it's an invisible train.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.42,0:05:24.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the train go by?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:28.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it did, it's the most silentest,\Nmost invisiblest train ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on, let's go. Go where?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.72,0:05:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure, but I guess\Nwe'll know when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.48,0:05:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this is the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.38,0:05:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find a snack bar\Nand get some cotton candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.96,0:05:44.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Places like this always have cotton candy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.18,0:05:45.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They make candy from cotton?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.40,0:05:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I bet there's popcorn and snow\Ncones and soft pretzels and ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.06,0:05:52.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:53.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.76,0:05:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go see!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.96,0:05:56.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last one, there's a rotten egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.58,0:06:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, check this out! Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.38,0:06:15.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let me scream!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.86,0:06:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The streets feel like they're\Nmade out of marshmallows.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.82,0:06:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Real squishy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you thinking all of\Nthose toys fall off the trees?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.20,0:06:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we can't just lie\Nhere forever, can we?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.00,0:06:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we better keep looking around
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.06,0:06:49.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute. I hear some\Nstrange noises over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.90,0:06:53.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.06,0:07:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cradles. Lots of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.66,0:07:04.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now? Betamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.94,0:07:06.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a baby Digimon. A baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.88,0:07:10.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, he's so soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:12.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's because he was just born.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the other ones?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:15.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.36,0:07:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this one called?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.64,0:07:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Poon-a-man. Poon-a-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:20.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poon-a-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.49,0:07:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poon-a-man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.41,0:07:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poon-a-man is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.32,0:07:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's micro-tiny.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.18,0:07:26.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh, what's with this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:29.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks more like a grandpa with\Na big beard. Oh, come on now,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.88,0:07:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,T.K. You don't mean that. This is a little\Nbaby Uriman. He's looking right at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.44,0:07:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.32,0:07:43.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.10,0:07:44.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Achoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.01,0:07:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Palmon, what are\Nthese? What are what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.30,0:07:53.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a Digi-Egg. Hey, no\Nway! It's the egg of a Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.18,0:07:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I like the pretty paint,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.38,0:07:58.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but are you saying that Digimon\Nhatch out of eggs just like chickens?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:07:59.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't grow in the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.00,0:08:00.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even Devimon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.22,0:08:03.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm, unfortunately. What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.08,0:08:05.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.28,0:08:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.19,0:08:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's written in Digi-Code.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says, rub gently. Rub gently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.40,0:08:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rub what, I wonder?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:17.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think maybe we're\Nsupposed to rub the egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.38,0:08:22.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.29,0:08:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't I give it a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.80,0:08:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe a digital genie will come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.34,0:08:30.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna wish for a new skateboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just hatched.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.68,0:08:37.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we need to find him his own cradle.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.16,0:08:40.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see if there's an extra one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.62,0:08:46.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're saying you didn't know\Nwhere you came from until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.58,0:08:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, can you remember things\Nfrom when you were a baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.78,0:08:53.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.69,0:08:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these pretty shapes\Nand colors do remind me
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.04,0:08:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of something from a long\Ntime ago. It was real
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.82,0:09:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sunny, I was playing\Nwith blocks, but I fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.00,0:09:05.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over or something And\NI remember I was crying
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.22,0:09:11.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there was someone\Nthere with me Someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.64,0:09:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know exactly who\NMaybe my brother Matt Anyway,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.86,0:09:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,somebody picked me up And I stopped crying
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.14,0:09:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Attaboy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.74,0:09:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's about all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.50,0:09:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I don't remember either You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.82,0:09:29.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.73,0:09:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's not so easy remembering\Nstuff from being a baby At least I
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.84,0:09:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,know it didn't come from an egg\NLet's go hatch some more digi eggs
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.34,0:09:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that there's anything\Nwrong with hatching from an egg
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.76,0:09:44.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sparkling Thunder!
