Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.37,0:09:52.53,Sign,ELECMON,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Type
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.37,0:09:52.53,Sign,ELECMON,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Data
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.37,0:09:52.53,Sign,ELECMON,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Special Attack
Dialogue: 1,0:09:44.37,0:09:52.53,Sign,ELECMON,0,0,0,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5}Sparkling Thunder
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.70,0:09:50.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am Elecmon, caretaker of baby Digimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't cross wires with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.92,0:09:57.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.84,0:09:59.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No worms, no hooks, no waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, little fishies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.60,0:10:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everybody out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.04,0:10:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This ought to be enough to feed those\Nlittle mouths for quite a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.26,0:10:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.04,0:10:17.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you had an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.48,0:10:27.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.39,0:10:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Palamon, I could\Nuse some help over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.78,0:10:32.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Tee-Tee, not now. Don't cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.88,0:10:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.90,0:10:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.02,0:10:37.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am busy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:39.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know anything about babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.64,0:10:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.80,0:10:49.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catching lots of fish is great, but\Nhauling them all home is not. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.60,0:10:51.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My babies are all crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.06,0:10:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, babies. I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.32,0:11:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Easy, Dad.\NDon't worry. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.66,0:11:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Intruders, invaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'll teach them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.22,0:11:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.28,0:11:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.76,0:11:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.76,0:11:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Super Thunderstrike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch where you're aiming that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.40,0:11:48.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could hurt somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.82,0:11:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I could have.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.90,0:11:51.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what I was trying to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But why would you want to\Ndo anything to hurt us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.08,0:11:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I saw you playing with\Nmy babies, you interlopers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, we played with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.76,0:12:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what's that got to do with you? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.24,0:12:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, uh, uh, uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You barbarians.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.64,0:12:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always making the same mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.96,0:12:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not some ordinary Digimon who just\Nhappened to come along and catch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:18.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the primary village\Nhatchling ground and nursery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.36,0:12:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A very special place where\Nall Digimon start their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.24,0:12:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am a very special Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.24,0:12:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,entrusted with caring for\Neach and every one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.56,0:12:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you don't have to play Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.30,0:12:29.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Big Shot and fry us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.88,0:12:32.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was only trying to protect my babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.08,0:12:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I think this conversation\Nhas lasted long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.64,0:12:38.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am in charge and you\Ntwo are trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.68,0:12:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.34,0:12:41.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.34,0:12:43.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't get all puffy. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.40,0:12:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't call me puffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Catalan, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.10,0:13:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.82,0:13:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's Digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.62,0:13:13.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.16,0:13:15.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we do!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:21.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, they're fighting\Nworse than Matt and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.16,0:13:22.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they're not even brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.60,0:13:29.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.68,0:13:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fighting's no good for\Nsolving problems, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:43.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you did was mess up your\Nfur and scare all the babies
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.12,0:13:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My fur looks fine I'm so sorry,\Nlittle one I didn't mean to scare you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.06,0:13:55.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, punk, you better leave those babies\Nalone Don't even talk to them, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.82,0:13:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what I've heard, Popo?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.02,0:14:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trying too hard to act grown up is a\Nsign of immaturity What was that? Hey,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.98,0:14:04.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you got something to say to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.22,0:14:07.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then say it to my face Don't talk\Nbehind my back Come on out with it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.00,0:14:11.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you little wing-headed, two-toned pork\Nchop Tell me, or don't you have the guts?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.04,0:14:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:14.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK, can I...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.86,0:14:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I please teach his\Narrogant digitoad a lesson?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:20.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's\Ngoing to learn something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.40,0:14:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you guys really have to do this? Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.14,0:14:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we have to do it the right way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.84,0:14:26.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.04,0:14:29.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a great way to solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.44,0:14:39.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:46.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that corner, the\Ndefending champion, Elecmon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.88,0:14:53.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, over in the other corner,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.90,0:14:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the challenger and most excellent Digimon,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.62,0:14:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Patamon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.56,0:15:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, let the tug of war begin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:08.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On your mark, get set, and go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.18,0:15:17.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.24,0:15:19.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't let him beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.00,0:15:21.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.48,0:15:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Elecmon, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elecmon?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.24,0:15:55.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.82,0:15:58.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the winner is... Cannonball!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:15:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.44,0:16:01.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you did it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.80,0:16:07.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the terror of the tug-o-war.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want to try it one more time?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:11.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nope, you beat me fair and square.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.16,0:16:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my pleasure to welcome\Nyou to Primary Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.30,0:16:21.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry, Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.32,0:16:24.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no good excuse for the mean\Nway I acted when I first saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've been so upset\Nabout things around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:30.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since the island broke apart,\NI've been expecting a fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.52,0:16:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I guess I just took it out on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.76,0:16:33.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.58,0:16:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least kids make up pretty fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My parents are still mad at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.48,0:16:41.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the time I painted our kitty cat
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.32,0:16:46.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, you're a lot stronger than\Nyou look, kid I'm impressed You know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.46,0:16:50.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they say you can't tell a cover by the size\Nof its book Or something like that Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:55.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well forget about the sayings You're great\Nat tug-of-war Hey, take a look around
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday all this will be yours, Patamon,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:02.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my boy You'll raise up some fine young\NDigimon here Just like your old man Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.70,0:17:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Elecmon, I am not here to\Nraise babies. You're not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.40,0:17:11.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, of course you're not But I was\Njust, oh, I guess I was just daydreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.66,0:17:15.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I was serious about you staying here\Nfor a little while to get some rest,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:16.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,take care of the babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.56,0:17:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you won't rest much if you do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.12,0:17:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sounds great, Elecmon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.36,0:17:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By the way, how do we\Nget to that mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.96,0:17:25.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In Infinity Mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.20,0:17:27.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.10,0:17:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You actually want to climb up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.00,0:17:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.38,0:17:33.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's really not a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.40,0:17:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You need special tools, custom hiking\Nboots, gloves, all very expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.98,0:17:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plus you've got your snow up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.72,0:17:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's cold And poison ivy and snakes\Nand bugs and And there's Devimon Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.54,0:17:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was getting to that Devimon is, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's an evil Digimon I know,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:51.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I have to ask him about my\Nbrother and everyone else But he won't
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.86,0:17:55.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just tell you You'll have to fight\Nhim I don't want to fight ever
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:57.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:18:01.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,right There has to be some\Nother way to find out We need to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.16,0:18:04.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do it without fighting Devimon\NLike asking him pretty please?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.34,0:18:10.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, it's nothing like that Do you remember\Nhow it felt when we were all laughing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.36,0:18:11.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't help it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.66,0:18:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the next thing you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.64,0:18:14.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're looking at each\Nother and laughing and your
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.68,0:18:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,cheeks hurt like you've been\Nblowing up balloons all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.30,0:18:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Laughing's the best part of friendship.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.64,0:18:20.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.36,0:18:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.26,0:18:24.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all about laughing and being friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.86,0:18:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can use the power of friendship\Nto return the island to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.76,0:18:32.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go over to Gia Savannah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.80,0:18:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,where the Yokomon village is,\Nand tell everyone right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.62,0:18:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, and be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.68,0:18:43.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a feeling, but\NI really believe in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, TK, and thank you, Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.98,0:18:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he can help us, and maybe I'll\Nget back together with my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.76,0:18:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just know Matt's out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.24,0:18:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can almost see him,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.60,0:19:02.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I've got this yucky feeling that a\Nlot's going to happen between now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.38,0:19:07.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All but one of their\NDigimon have Digivolved. I
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.50,0:19:10.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,must destroy this last\None before it is too late
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.32,0:19:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe it\Nhas come to this Still,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.26,0:19:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as even one of those cursed\Nchildren is lost, I am pleased. Leomon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:26.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Master I leave this to you As you\Nwish, my lord What shall I do, Master?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.18,0:19:28.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What task do you have for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing for the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:34.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My loyal servant, but soon a\Nbattle will rage and you must be
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.96,0:19:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepared. I understand, my lord.\NThis time I will not fail you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no this time there will be no failure\Nthis time I shall be victorious
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what is it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.92,0:20:08.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm Koromon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.18,0:20:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on Digivolving.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.48,0:20:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Koromon
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, I'm your Digimon, T.K.\NAnd someday I'll Digivolve, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.78,0:20:24.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.20,0:20:26.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.86,0:20:28.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to Digivolve?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you're saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just saying it might happen,\Nbut I don't really want it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.60,0:20:38.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to stay like this forever,\Nalways by your side. Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.28,0:20:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can be best friends forever and ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.96,0:20:44.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course. Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.38,0:20:46.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.66,0:21:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.06,0:21:09.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.97,0:21:16.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:29.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much for watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.58,0:21:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.36,0:21:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to see you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's cold and cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.58,0:21:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing a jacket with my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.82,0:21:50.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to see you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.44,0:21:58.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The sky is the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.24,0:22:31.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wish you
